msgid "PRACTICE_FIRST_HINT"
msgstr "Putt into the hole. Follow the meter hints. A perfect hit is not required."

msgid "PRACTICE_DISTANCE_HINT"
msgstr "Stop the ball inside the yellow area. The distance scale assumes level grass."

msgid "PRACTICE_TIMING_HINT"
msgstr "Hold your shot for about a second. Wait for the open gate, then putt into the hole."

msgid "PRACTICE_BANK_HINT"
msgstr "Use a wall bounce to reach the hole. You can keep putting after the bounce."

msgid "PRACTICE_GRASS_HINT"
msgstr "Putt into the hole on grass. Here the scale matches the free rolling distance."

msgid "PRACTICE_SAND_HINT"
msgstr "Cross the sand and putt into the hole. Sand slows the ball more than grass."

msgid "PRACTICE_CONCRETE_HINT"
msgstr "Putt on concrete. It slows the ball less. The scale still shows grass distance."

msgid "PRACTICE_ICE_HINT"
msgstr "Cross the ice and putt in. It is very slippery. The scale still assumes grass."

msgid "PRACTICE_SLOPE_HINT"
msgstr "Cross the arrows and putt in. Arrows point downhill: going against them needs more power."

msgid "PRACTICE_GATE_HINT"
msgstr "Pass the gate and putt in. Prepare your shot and wait for the opening."

msgid "PRACTICE_ROTOR_HINT"
msgstr "Pass the rotor and putt in. Watch its rotation from a safe distance."

msgid "PRACTICE_SEESAW_HINT"
msgstr "Enter the low left end, cross the seesaw and putt in. The raised end bounces the ball back."

